  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Soil 501.02 Scope.\n\n(a) The following rules of professional conduct shall be binding upon every person holding a certificate of soil science, certification of wetland science, approval as a wetland or soil apprentice, and on all partnerships, corporations, or other legal entities authorized to offer or perform the practice of soil science or wetland science in this state.\n\nSource. #4676, eff 9-20-89, EXPIRED: 9-20-95\n\nNew. #6232, eff 4-26-96; ss by #6881, eff 11-13-98; ss by #8621, eff 5-2-06; ss by #9886-A, eff 3-11-11, EXPIRED: 3-11-19\n\nNew. #13814, eff 1-28-24 (formerly Soil 501.01)",
